FreelancerSimulator
├── FreelancerProfile     (skills, rates, risk aversion, capacity)
├── Strategy              (abstract; implements decide(opportunity) → action)
│   ├── NaiveStrategy     (bid on everything)
│   ├── GreedyEVStrategy  (bid on highest EV, boost optimally)
│   └── PortfolioStrategy (balance PPH proposals + Fiverr gigs + rest)
├── Platform              (abstract; generates opportunities, applies fees)
│   ├── PPHPlatform
│   ├── UpworkPlatform
│   └── FiverrPlatform
├── Market                (generates job streams, seasonality, trends)
└── Simulation            (runs the loop, collects metrics)
